[INFO] reading  -- Erdos-Kac (normal, mean log log x) is a statement about the UNIFORM measure on n<=x; under the canonical zeta measure at sigma>1 the prime occupations are independent geometrics with finite total mean -- the manuscript's Erdos-Kac theorem is correctly stated for the uniform (microcanonical-shell) ensemble; the two ensembles differ, as its ensemble-bridge remark says.

